{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1469,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1edc0b0c0d242f3748feab02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "聖蹄祭…家族が見に来てくれるから\r\n毎年そわそわしちゃいます。おれの\r\n今を、見てもらえるのが嬉しくて！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e9d29bfcd4f61ca5ffd56d176c4103f52c8072fd9f4f430d347a8090e710a5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9e0cf38fc90189253963c06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、寒くないですか？\r\nおれ、何かあったかいものでも\r\n買ってき…くしゅっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1a13dc2e885f4be887fb5646140bdf45384b5ea93fcfa13ceb384a7fbe5558a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8494558f7e74761af828b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えっと、ハッピーバレンタイン。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77b852e72dc9bda1bc425e257b4fa6d24faf99490d0f7c9d7dcf4ba0bc2dddff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6584f696f9ba741aebbf45d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "また家族と長電話しちゃいました。\r\nトレーニングのこと、友人のこと…\r\nいま楽しいこと、全部伝えたくて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "445eb3f8e2b0cec0cace4ab6c31b779cd8b554a0c88bc3c4dff289c205b96574",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdf13c44dbc2ec15116d9625",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尊敬する人…主治医の先生です。\r\n諦めず、腐らず、挑み続けて…\r\nおれも、そうありたいなって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a5107f48bca4478a1e7595a0ecedc85ea6c4a41a253b7d15f8ce34b4e180c8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a81a2b8014b1958e0586fa81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この間、寮の部屋に花を飾ったら\r\nルビーがじっと見てて…ふふ、\r\n気に入ってくれたのかなぁ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0baa044bed7546d8b49fa3cbe2949bc0f70aa81dd44b8da798f29d7192522966",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb295d7af2d10c9e000467b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "また絵本、増やしちゃいました…\r\n場所を取るから実家に送ったのに、\r\n本屋で一目ぼれすると、つい…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2152a1d142f9e0aedc8ca5f5f2d3b86558c896d22bfb01e620b445a3b18de74e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a7aec0a945a8cd9881ed05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれのピアノ、独学なんですよね。\r\n最初は見様見真似で。ただ、誰かに\r\n少しでも楽しんでもらえたらって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7590a53c40d0c2e4625799d56342862db821f4885e722c97dde3f2be514061",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beb5c0aed41a1996b5d98f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっとたくさんライブしたいな。\r\nファンのみんな、それぞれ全員に\r\nありがとうの気持ちが届くように！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ec5b1682bdcf0b9ce5330748be0d7e3087a1efb7459bf84bf1f0f1d5727c0ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df66030d692d5bee6a42a913",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンスレッスン、楽しいですよね。\r\n動きをみんなに合わせたり、時には\r\nサポートしたりもできますし。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6abf25fa346a65ae44d0c339cf57cf990d2ea3f4dba742cfec6efd9195ed2a02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b52d968285299b28842dd9ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜空みたいなこの服を着るたび、\r\nおれも輝けたらって思うんです。\r\n誰かが願いをかける、星みたいに。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b1848731b5d1bfd0ffa1373c5252e6335bed1ef0a24abcf4b97f2cdf86c2fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c62f86e2e8f856e14a08ddaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなの願いと、奇跡で織られた\r\nこの服は…本当に大切な、\r\nおれの誇りなんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2a8aecc1d902ca720f3d22b44a4ac27adc8cbbf576d0f29e155e6056e93a09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd285edadc0cbe32362e1708",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝はランニングしたあと、みんなが\r\n来る前に教室を掃除するのが、\r\nひそかな楽しみなんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e4e3f8b8fb5fd6cfd312654ab1ea356d4a8dc7c2ae1740949bcb1bb8de7bc6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a8433f43776a52cd3fcfed5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼休みにピアノを弾いてると、\r\nゼファーが喜んでくれるんです。\r\n軽やかな曲が特に好きみたいで。",
      "source_fingerprint": "422dc26d67129eed4caf8a0a711dbf4e2683aaa5ad4f65567dc2fd0813539747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb764678dc5b78d15197c363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜は…寮で勉強が多いですね。\r\n理学療法士の資格に興味があって。\r\nおれも、いつかは…なんて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d940557c0fb7cb827674374d501a2499b53a4092393f388ea54e7cc32ee1378a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41738d3aaf3fb12a61548853",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春一番…力強くて華やかで、\r\nゼファーの走りを思い出しますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e5671111486d1e99540dd09bdf041b95ea1e84256ff816e9800f7e8b72485e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab46b6033aee505579882586",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏バテが怖い時期ですよね…。\r\nなのでスタミナがつくレシピ、\r\n看護師さんに教えてもらいました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c008619f80804a4803f83cb10dabfc543223d2822bb6380bef2dd206086e01b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1a4573eec2ec6020709a712",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落ち葉を掃除するのって、楽しい\r\nですよね！たまに綺麗な葉っぱを\r\n見つけてとっておいたりして…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fb0d517827e5a7a58004dce87a507f8a1cd240a68f77bbade0576c0f92fd7ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e5c9a2485d9156115ebc031",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬は、なんとなく寂しいような…\r\nどこかで震えている人がいないか、\r\n探しちゃうような季節ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8e4c7f80213bce162e5f3eb2cc6e52d016eec104f7a8a53812562690fba5142",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec3c3a1b73c4f33032d3b1bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も、よろしくお願いします。\r\n厳しくても大丈夫ですよ、\r\n絶対ついていきますから…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77fac756eb2138351bc3d62cd43728350693232078a04a21e8c37bef511592ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbf8a496bb39e7fdeb022bd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2ad9ef1cf9686afb294a15074782ad81114f3c3315923361e8f74b782776ce8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec0fc9499384fa6e7661406f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "運動するのって、楽しいですね！\r\nみんなやトレーナーさんのおかげで\r\n走れてると思うと、なおさら！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2d1e7c789af5dc3dfa36ff89e87cd5a6d7be450ed2b3ae343101ef7891bd993",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d748a3388fa6ab60dc02099b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "たくさん鍛えてください。\r\nこの積み重ねがいつか奇跡を\r\n呼ぶって、信じてますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "363a744cb0d26b47a0ab89033e0c7e26d203c70351f68a58ab54205ae1f13252",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b083f8eb484ba2b90a415bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "準備はばっちりです。\r\nお昼ご飯、ちょっと多めに\r\n食べましたし…と、当社比で！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e30353d76ec2ba80ec94cd784a850783181af77eed0b8de1d24aab3edf8766e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f63e063439c0ca9339c71661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ありがとうって…いつも思ってます\r\nこうして今日も、一緒に\r\nトレーニングできることに。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da174224d26e7bd0a27763e3471bfc6098b24618950c750fdd2186e2feb0fe05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78385fe840d8f791ddfe2432",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれのことも、頼ってくださいね。\r\n生意気かもしれないけど…たまには\r\n寄りかかってほしいんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc42694c408e7f7b9897bc8f954623c4995ba12eca046d7241e01b6f03fa0af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60ea4b2e8867766f743f5377",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近、思うんです。\r\nトレーナーさんと一緒なら、\r\n本当に『大丈夫』なんだなって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f13fc098048f448297e6afa5dac7215a42370397ec5c7c272ed389d2a68dc31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2e1155780bc03485855b43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "風、波、空…全部。\r\nおれたちのこと、\r\n応援してくれてる気がします！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de70f05853febe1f2fd6ce5b68338d1c50f8ccfb05ffca0a12a782ccce44a0f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c0f0dff1b7fcf0e3bb669a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなに――あなたに！\r\nありがとうって、伝わりましたか…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3865d0ce00528babd39fa70e4f03feae33fda347e308c9f147c55290e4fe4ac2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52d4526620aa46680cb62435",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あなたと、おれと。\r\n2人だから起こせた、奇跡です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3330a181f0481024d3fbb831ba35039fe332b72f683d4eeeee234c64ad83f18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f693e54f85364c8534b0b566",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1歩ごとに、全力で。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5eb1d40e73c908c2594a667ab523268f128a6267885703c393eace17b384d44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e231b1d83ccfcd01f0e64a5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれ、まだまだ速くなれますよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8766c22fcf09c4ee5d73e76c5a023f151a26298b22aa9c6ac926cac6d8773cfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3860112db5b8a736efdb1148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ケイエスミラクルです。\r\n頑張りますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c897c2cdb33d49b92f443ba477d9a1c1d2dbdcac05deb3b77039b720e2fb788b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cf0069067e5f7bd77cf0f35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇跡を起こします。\r\nおれの全部は、そのためにある！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c7c915e5745afea6cfbe205b46bca33665009a6818185e88405cb39a40f89f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50772e7034ec1851b114fe8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "役に立てるなら嬉しいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e6930c651f11ad57a2e368d39f530be6efccc505f475e1533169ce76f9fdfae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9646e02d5fa9528c7d3c800",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手伝えること増えたみたいだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea3f07e1132fe6eddad1eef9dd41dd1edb8bf47fac1fce1e9511aede173f5fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ef4ff61c92743a7f7f9163",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任しとけ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d3b7a263ece17766655fe5984b47c303bc95e32b16709bf7d9e28faf78d1a06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c0eb5b969761b65c31e1d3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝って勝って、勝ちまくる。\r\n誰が相手だろうと、ぶち抜く。\r\nなんぞ、最強！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13ee9396505f3581aa46697b4e26469aa0ebc3249b8abbc21fde1a35b51e40a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c2541ed779e78fbe6d794ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f06e9d5d4b590fa75db11b1c2431f76a413069b4adaae557632a142ae95ad45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2be4cc3e390097dba64d010",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったぜー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b3827a60410454db92086ecf75acc2a90391f3378ed47ce2dd4a1472475c21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:919bd7d77f964586575453f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "俺は俺の道を進む。けどよ、スジが\r\n通んねーと思ったら止めてくれ。\r\n任したぜ、お前に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87bbeed51a9a547ba5e0a947f9af6555e6fbaf9acd166187ac45d49189362f14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6645c64685d8a18441f2c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お前は、やる時はやるヤツだ。\r\nもっと胸張れよ――相棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d61f99e6d1eec3a786f5420521f93d6cba1573040c41d2341b3189f36e2c0731",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:613e280de63991c8445619a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年早々、果たし状かよ。\r\nしゃーねぇ…\r\n景気よくぶち抜いてくっか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81623bf42f4d6ee2de530cfd9b46e88b5f0127208ffaa960a9eb4ad9c414504d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cfe1b380b3586925ca642e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコパーティーすっから来いよ！\r\nすんげー数用意してっからさ、\r\nどれが1番か決めようぜ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6e0fe621d0c3de7a86d127b2df396a0baae63786b09572a111d211366bdc43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a46044d800aef8d9db5523c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美味ぇチョコ色々探したんだが、\r\n選びきれねーってか…全部やるよ！\r\n好きなだけ食ってくれ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f211f9bcc3f41ce595a83b0117706115005b2a4d53c420c57085d98aa5a58a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa32063500dd5c6d3e2767dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誰だよ…俺よりたけーとこに\r\n短冊結んだヤツ？オイ、肩車しろ！\r\nもっと上に掲げてやらァ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac70a7860b2fbf7e5edb437160aaad989a8748de815d746b472b76856d435949",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe6bc1b4f6fba88fd74568e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "な、なあ！オバケの仮装だらけで\r\nビビってんだろ！？しゃーねぇ、\r\n側にいてやるよ！なっ？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc08e32381ffd4694085945db1ac193b0f7f815af28ca77cdfa278171a092896",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76002535b487329777697e9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家じゃアニキがサンタ役でよ。\r\nそんなんが嬉しかったっけ…。\r\nあー、今日くらい電話してやっか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46b93066ab649f05a87b496886d26bf2bd51cb7814e9d4ae76e33288c039676d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8620e6c6a97eb9a3db2f93db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…お前のためだ…今回は譲る。\r\nいいか、ありがた～く食えよ…\r\nクリスマスケーキに載ったサンタ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb5ce9da4008c021a5155424e352b05d761add37d40273c1c4579936afde5db3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5a1a7939a6de82ff90cba2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "へっ、やったな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc393df6ffec3d43d29bfcb6f461393ba1bc99c6edc2a15a5d3bfaa425c4cc8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653f8f89bcaee608544815dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来たな、お笑いの年末が！\r\n漫才、コント、トークショー…\r\n徹夜だ徹夜ァー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07bf6dbca8215378a3ac81cb5d9e66998482e0fe576acb23c5a10f035725c00f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b72ea38fe705dc8e85322d86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日おめっとさん！\r\nいっぱいツレ呼んでよ。\r\nパーッと行こうぜー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a6fbdc7cff0bc4d06f6277e242a45e9986c7f4c33b0609acd2f89e1b9757c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06ec4b6403053569020daaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼント持ってきたぞー。\r\n揃いの特服だ…ヘヘッ。\r\n相棒にゃピッタリだろ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f829b026777ba1409136fa7bd7f01d810fbbecae7217601bba61e15c63c8eea9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d03fcb2dce1bd5a34d838098",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いやー、仲間からのプレゼントが\r\n止まんねーの！明日も\r\n誕生日になんねーかなぁ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a8e11fbe8158d6b8b813a7fc52300de1f5ea69c839c65eb72b37e0dcdbf5f7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de5b1765d30b67bc5a420be2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おう、お祝いサンキューな。\r\nなにが変わるワケでもねぇけどさ。\r\nま、これからも頼むな、マジで。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d22ec8d7705d22531f61a55d20568a379030d34692a9b74146673d951a44158c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51c625fe20bb20ac67b0a1f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新しい知らせが来てんな。\r\n果たし状なら受けて立つぜ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1a1fdc68a8f93f004a0864d6699b06b1a6c70eda4edc058b9b4a9ff22c5463",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0315ba80e911bbeb50c45cc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お、プレゼント届いてんぞ。\r\nいいもんじゃねーか！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03bbe8a63e9fa741f0096ae82182f0aaaed2c44a2df66ac0f0a61bb84d9e50d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e62554f44e9c4099f804105a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッションクリアか、やるなー。\r\nさっすが俺の相棒だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeb0df167bf2d30315b2bb7f8223f9886b0d2f2b90af5dd8fc96020e5d03cd99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e088fcf7d25769250ad5e017",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おお、今度イベントやるって！\r\nいつだよ？早く来ねーかなー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ce19a8bd6469be9e8859e882e12e7694c23270d68e940646b4f9aa41f3b7a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bc80aec24f56f64c1b74486",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほら、イベント行こうぜ。\r\n楽しまねーと損だろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "064b9b498758d814d05d213dbcec69123d96ad92c20599c436260b03523808ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db2b17328af062b6f45b2150",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次はぜってー勝つぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1079ca3f86b17a7bfba2c8da67222af6503fd37be6d92cf2ece028ad87145a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d775171815fd50d4c09b1a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お、名鑑レベル上がってんな！\r\nやるじゃねェか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afe0d39efd8abac5d37cdb910ba1a5615c1f989e98a1eb7c219955b772ecd3ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a254cc718afe60a62fc9aacc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるじゃねェか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3b419b29f62b88284ed4fba68ab6aebd261a073053580463df604d40aa4ab00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1782aea43df545a2652daf10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなもんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f564a92be979d0bfae35a8c081f01a2db335e6cdd79684f4893ebfee11dc18e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:501ab151eb40d2e5f53ac6c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次はぜってー勝つぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1079ca3f86b17a7bfba2c8da67222af6503fd37be6d92cf2ece028ad87145a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9b9864a05f9739b27300aa1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるじゃねェか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3b419b29f62b88284ed4fba68ab6aebd261a073053580463df604d40aa4ab00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a7451e2a6a9caa941b44833",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "俺たち無敵だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb02f0451c3c4ddf4d0e8247282a323293f902d38cd828813c5a639b0cb76da8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75aba2ca146a8eeb2add34ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ま、俺に任せとけって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "947d66144eca5113af0f12f88112a6d8c0eba6386af585907fc98d4bc283efd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95ddff341f2fd33bcdb5d499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb4ba876dfface4e0920bf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングだな。\r\n目指すぞ、最強！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46159389e430c9161bd98ab9b7e15293342758343c2e9cdde7aac797eb7b9e0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe3a45916ece773a6a93bc62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おもしれぇ話ばっかだなー。\r\nお前も読んでみろよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00db2b12b20afe741c44276a09b22fabacabed2d3718206151d8dace6cf5d0e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c16921368b3b9ce0b74e53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レース上等！\r\nかましてやろうぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be40b12abd28329d53e862a68f6dc7d436e8451e060053387fed7bb428523a52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee4c450cc1b3364117ed8ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“最強”獲んぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67e6b121b8a9336995f82e04a3dc3062bdafd5a4bdffd26fb104e7fa1ff6e6b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86676dbf36abff4ca11fe60d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘、プリティーダービー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfce02d59976c4a687f79d00d7894df0b5a6c879fbee1d653e3f267a88ff06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e54895038f767f0f789eca62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "すっげえ力…\r\n最高だな！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f5dbb53158f1fc8d8676fe7ce83a4010dd8e800b8b37a97069dbce1eed7be0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0bbe351b150368e6a2a3f7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて、やるか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "212c07d81b0a458db13f0a95c67cf2e230fcc8352f6d08fe7535afb2d5c615c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "1205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434a588b41d014723d1c043b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほら、今日のログインボーナスな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01a9a15188bcf7df542278297d1065f3dfec130a4429a37203413b3f9c2c17a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beed582bfc230a60b2de6ae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よく狙えよー？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a24cf4e91428cc6c78eb816717bcd14a464d633477f39e4613d44c0e1556619",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6636401e187595547f9fdb87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるなー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce72d3728ff716daf34a392799bb9dfeae71f5a5d1840385a78e15d11d325d4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3ddf66c399f2b72707dc535",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぬあっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fe7f671274feeb6bb26daaf5c622c4e5b9b444b160aadea65bfa2ed5e92ef99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
